WEBVTT

01:29.980 --> 01:32.240
<b>Episode 12</b>

01:29.980 --> 01:32.240
<b>And The One She Chooses Is</b>

01:38.780 --> 01:41.220
A being that can kill me?

01:41.810 --> 01:43.580
Perhaps that was true.

01:44.010 --> 01:48.570
Maybe I did long for that for a time.

01:50.110 --> 01:50.900
Mio.

01:52.130 --> 01:55.730
It's not a lie that I was 
trying to resurrect Shin.

01:56.380 --> 02:00.970
I have kept on living 
so I could see Shin one more time.

02:02.150 --> 02:04.330
But as you said:

02:04.330 --> 02:08.510
"Is the man I gave birth to truly Shin?"

02:08.510 --> 02:10.660
That doubt lingered in part of my mind.

02:12.060 --> 02:17.170
Though I had no idea 
what else I was supposed to do.

02:19.750 --> 02:21.200
I see.

02:21.200 --> 02:25.390
Perhaps I truly did want to die all this time.

02:30.500 --> 02:33.950
How did I never realize 
something so simple before?

02:37.430 --> 02:42.330
If you came to kiss me 
while understanding all of that,

02:43.570 --> 02:47.660
then that means 
you intend to kill me, doesn't it?

02:50.850 --> 02:51.690
Yes.

02:53.860 --> 02:56.690
Is that what you thought I'd say?

02:57.250 --> 02:57.870
Huh?

02:58.780 --> 03:02.620
Sorry, but I don't have the nerves 
of steel you've shown.

03:03.100 --> 03:05.270
I'm not going to shoulder 
the burden of your death.

03:05.870 --> 03:07.420
You see, Mio,

03:07.830 --> 03:11.960
I came here to steal you away from Shinji!

03:14.500 --> 03:17.980
Right now all ten sephirah reside within me.

03:17.980 --> 03:20.840
I can probably seal away 
your Spirit power as well.

03:21.140 --> 03:24.540
But sealing you shouldn't equal death.

03:24.540 --> 03:27.230
Not as long as you don't choose death yourself.

03:28.700 --> 03:30.170
So with that...

03:32.930 --> 03:38.790
Forget about your old love 
and come hook up with me, Mio.

03:48.430 --> 03:52.090
What was that? 
That doesn't suit you at all, Shido.

03:52.090 --> 03:54.960
Are you even being serious?

03:54.960 --> 03:57.890
S-Setting aside whether that suited me or not!

03:57.890 --> 03:59.050
I'm serious!

03:59.050 --> 04:01.840
I genuinely intend to 
steal you away from Shinji!

04:03.470 --> 04:04.620
I see.

04:05.870 --> 04:09.470
That's what he says, 
but what do you think, Shin?

04:09.870 --> 04:12.250
Am I allowed to say something here?

04:12.250 --> 04:15.850
I'm just something separated 
from Shido's memories.

04:15.850 --> 04:18.860
I'm basically an imitation of an imitation?

04:19.200 --> 04:22.970
But your memories are those of Shin's, right?

04:22.970 --> 04:24.130
So speak.

04:24.130 --> 04:28.370
Whatever you're thinking should be 
the same as what the real Shinji would.

04:29.010 --> 04:32.130
Otherwise, I might just get 
stolen away by Shido, you know?

04:33.810 --> 04:34.870
Is that so?

04:36.630 --> 04:38.660
In that case, I will speak my mind.

04:39.380 --> 04:41.760
Screw you, bastard!

04:41.760 --> 04:42.850
O-Oh?!

04:42.060 --> 04:44.680
You keep saying whatever you 
damn well please while I hold my tongue!

04:44.680 --> 04:46.470
But even I can't forgive you for this!

04:47.050 --> 04:53.250
I'm never handing Mio over to you!

04:54.980 --> 04:58.490
So yeah, that's how I would feel 
were I still alive.

04:59.060 --> 05:00.110
Though...

05:00.660 --> 05:02.420
I don't exist anymore, right?

05:04.860 --> 05:08.130
Honestly, the thought of Mio 
choosing anyone other than me

05:08.130 --> 05:10.180
makes my heart feel like it'll burst.

05:10.940 --> 05:14.670
But even so, I don't want Mio 
to choose death either.

05:15.560 --> 05:19.670
There were still so many things 
in this world that I wanted to show Mio.

05:22.510 --> 05:24.140
This ocean is pretty.

05:24.660 --> 05:27.970
I'm really glad I got to bring Mio here.

05:28.790 --> 05:29.580
But

05:30.130 --> 05:32.770
it's about time she visits somewhere else, too.

05:34.070 --> 05:35.450
I'm sorry, Mio.

05:36.180 --> 05:38.730
I've kept you tied down for far too long.

05:44.530 --> 05:45.210
Mio.

05:46.770 --> 05:49.570
Shido, I...

05:51.560 --> 05:53.060
Wh-What?!

05:53.060 --> 05:54.660
Reine, is this?!

05:54.660 --> 05:56.560
Interference from outside.

05:56.560 --> 05:58.970
It's most likely the Spirit Formula.

05:58.970 --> 06:00.500
Spirit Formula?

06:00.950 --> 06:06.550
The formula once used to create 
a Spirit, meaning me, in this world.

06:06.550 --> 06:08.430
It's a secret magic ritual.

06:09.380 --> 06:13.810
As far as I know, the only one 
capable of activating it is Westcott.

06:13.810 --> 06:15.060
Hold on a minute!

06:15.330 --> 06:19.750
Are you saying they're trying 
to give birth to a new Spirit outside?

06:19.750 --> 06:20.990
It would seem so.

06:21.540 --> 06:23.970
He wants another Spirit of Origin like me.

06:24.850 --> 06:28.850
And this time it looks like Westcott 
is at the center of that power.

06:29.270 --> 06:34.020
Apparently he's trying to use himself 
as a core while activating it.

06:34.450 --> 06:40.060
You mean Westcott is trying to 
gain the power of a Spirit of Origin?!

06:40.060 --> 06:41.460
The same level of power Mio wields?!

06:42.070 --> 06:42.860
Yes.

06:43.410 --> 06:48.340
A massive flow of Spirit Power 
is already gathered here in me.

06:48.990 --> 06:54.070
Westcott intends to use this flow 
to make himself a Spirit of Origin.

06:55.110 --> 06:59.260
He doesn't even need all ten sephirah anymore,

06:59.660 --> 07:03.480
since he can just use the power 
manifested here as-is.

07:03.820 --> 07:07.650
Maybe that's what Westcott 
was planning from the beginning?

07:07.650 --> 07:08.770
Most likely.

07:08.770 --> 07:12.110
He probably knew about 
the situation ahead of time.

07:12.660 --> 07:14.250
Because of me?

07:14.250 --> 07:17.740
He was able to learn about what 
I experienced in the future through Beelzebub.

07:18.230 --> 07:23.180
No, if anything is responsible 
for causing this, then that's me.

07:23.180 --> 07:27.010
Besides, we don't have time to be 
regretting things right now, right?

07:27.460 --> 07:28.510
That's right.

07:29.150 --> 07:32.000
I refuse to be used by that man,

07:32.000 --> 07:35.670
and letting him overwrite the world that holds 
my memories with Shin would be even worse.

07:36.290 --> 07:38.490
Shido, lend me your power.

07:38.930 --> 07:42.850
I know this might sound strange coming from me

07:42.850 --> 07:44.980
after I killed all the Spirits in the future,

07:46.060 --> 07:47.750
but let's go save everyone!

07:48.720 --> 07:49.460
Yeah!

07:50.380 --> 07:51.370
Shin.

07:51.370 --> 07:52.110
Yeah.

07:53.500 --> 07:54.870
I'll be going.

07:55.330 --> 07:57.470
Mhmm, take care.

07:58.450 --> 07:59.290
Shido.

07:59.690 --> 08:00.430
Huh?

08:01.180 --> 08:05.040
Uhh, then pardon me.

08:05.990 --> 08:08.180
Thank you for the ultimate date.

08:08.760 --> 08:10.050
Reine...

08:10.740 --> 08:12.470
I know you'll be okay.

08:16.670 --> 08:18.470
Now, let's go.

08:18.930 --> 08:19.620
Yeah!

08:31.990 --> 08:33.240
Shido!

08:31.990 --> 08:33.240
Boy!

08:31.990 --> 08:33.240
Darling!

08:33.240 --> 08:34.490
Shido!

08:33.240 --> 08:34.490
Master!

08:34.490 --> 08:35.570
Shido!

08:34.490 --> 08:35.570
Brother!

08:35.570 --> 08:36.490
Shido!

08:36.490 --> 08:38.490
Sorry for the wait, everyone!

08:39.810 --> 08:42.500
Hey, Isaac Westcott.

08:42.810 --> 08:47.250
It looks like you've really had your way 
with things while we were gone.

08:47.940 --> 08:51.500
I'm grateful to you, Shido Itsuka.

08:51.830 --> 08:58.690
After all, you're the one who kept 
Deus in place while I activated my formula.

09:01.370 --> 09:02.390
Belial!

09:14.690 --> 09:15.860
Belial?!

09:15.860 --> 09:17.740
It's a Demon King.

09:18.530 --> 09:22.240
One with power on par with Mio's Angel.

09:24.670 --> 09:26.640
Shido, that's!

09:26.640 --> 09:31.180
He's planning to fundamentally 
rewrite this world!

09:32.550 --> 09:33.510
Mio?

09:33.880 --> 09:35.050
Ein Sof.

09:44.680 --> 09:45.780
Mio!

09:45.780 --> 09:47.310
I can't hold this for long!

09:47.310 --> 09:50.600
Everyone, please, lend me your power!

09:50.600 --> 09:54.320
So I can protect this world where I met Shin!

09:57.660 --> 09:58.740
What's this?

10:03.910 --> 10:06.980
Oh! Is this—?!

10:08.150 --> 10:11.000
Still, we're up against another Spirit.

10:11.000 --> 10:15.490
We'll need to coalesce everyone's 
power in order to fully defeat him.

10:15.490 --> 10:18.380
Coalesce our power?

10:18.380 --> 10:20.180
Can you do that?

10:21.020 --> 10:23.020
He's right here, isn't he?

10:23.020 --> 10:26.910
The one man who can 
wield the power of all the Angels.

10:30.090 --> 10:31.650
Here we go, everyone!

10:31.650 --> 10:33.190
To save the world!

10:37.360 --> 10:38.820
You think I'd let you?!

10:38.820 --> 10:39.700
We won't let you through!

10:53.610 --> 10:54.630
Belial!

10:55.090 --> 10:56.590
Gabriel!

11:00.410 --> 11:02.590
Use this power as well!

11:03.090 --> 11:05.260
Zaphkiel, Aleph!

11:09.020 --> 11:11.100
Halvanhelv!

11:17.610 --> 11:20.490
Michael, Siffleur!

11:24.050 --> 11:25.190
Camael!

11:36.180 --> 11:38.050
Not bad.

11:38.050 --> 11:41.140
How about this, then?

11:41.140 --> 11:42.430
Athiel!

11:45.790 --> 11:47.140
That's!

11:51.210 --> 11:52.020
Huh?

11:54.460 --> 11:56.290
Don't worry!

11:56.290 --> 12:00.410
You can rest easy 
now that I'm back in business!

12:02.510 --> 12:04.440
Well done, Nia.

12:04.440 --> 12:08.790
I've raised your usefulness rating 
from paramecium to water flea.

12:08.790 --> 12:10.050
That voice?

12:10.050 --> 12:11.660
Are you Maria?

12:12.530 --> 12:15.880
Yes. I've obtained my long-awaited real body,

12:15.880 --> 12:17.670
and now I'm the perfect Maria.

12:18.740 --> 12:22.810
Nibeelcole was a pseudo-Spirit 
created by Beelzebub.

12:22.810 --> 12:27.180
So there's no reason 
the same couldn't be done with Raziel.

12:27.180 --> 12:31.340
Of course, the individual units 
hit with Athiel's power can't be resurrected,

12:31.340 --> 12:34.090
but it's possible for me 
to protect you all with this body,

12:34.090 --> 12:36.310
even if only for a brief time.

12:36.690 --> 12:38.400
Go, Maria!

12:38.400 --> 12:40.150
I choose you!

12:40.620 --> 12:42.690
Maria won't obey.

12:42.690 --> 12:43.820
Ow!

12:44.500 --> 12:48.370
Now, leave your defense to me and go, Shido.

12:48.370 --> 12:50.950
Go put an end to this.

12:51.370 --> 12:52.160
Yeah!

12:56.530 --> 12:57.460
Metatron!

12:58.210 --> 12:59.100
Raziel!

13:01.460 --> 13:02.910
Zaphkiel!

13:04.340 --> 13:05.840
Zadkiel!

13:06.640 --> 13:07.970
Camael!

13:10.010 --> 13:11.130
Michael!

13:12.790 --> 13:13.890
Haniel!

13:14.820 --> 13:15.870
Raphael!

13:16.980 --> 13:18.170
Gabriel!

13:18.900 --> 13:20.570
Sandalphon!

13:24.180 --> 13:26.100
Go, Shido!

13:26.100 --> 13:26.950
Yeah!

13:27.260 --> 13:28.990
Shido Itsuka!

13:54.140 --> 13:57.500
Splendidly done, Shido Itsuka.

13:58.450 --> 14:02.210
But you were one step shy.

14:02.210 --> 14:03.020
What?!

14:04.390 --> 14:05.910
Qemetiel!

14:11.780 --> 14:12.850
Shido!

14:11.780 --> 14:12.850
Boy!

14:11.780 --> 14:12.850
Master!

14:11.780 --> 14:12.850
Darling!

14:11.780 --> 14:12.850
Brother!

14:12.850 --> 14:13.790
Shido!

14:19.540 --> 14:21.290
You can't, Shido.

14:23.580 --> 14:24.680
Mio!

14:24.680 --> 14:27.920
You have all those girls waiting for you.

14:28.830 --> 14:31.000
His Spirit Power is out of control.

14:31.000 --> 14:34.890
If we leave that alone, 
it'll blow away the entire world.

14:35.930 --> 14:40.200
But if I use my Ein to cancel it out,

14:40.200 --> 14:42.580
then I might be able to stop it.

14:42.940 --> 14:43.750
Wha?!

14:43.750 --> 14:46.240
But if you do that, then you'll—!

14:48.030 --> 14:50.410
Even Shinji said it to you, didn't he?!

14:50.410 --> 14:52.950
He wanted you to see more of this world!

14:53.280 --> 14:55.160
So why would you—?!

14:57.090 --> 15:00.970
Shido, you really are wonderful.

15:00.970 --> 15:03.140
I do love you.

15:04.630 --> 15:09.210
Just second to Shinji, you know?

15:12.930 --> 15:18.940
Mio!

15:32.020 --> 15:34.140
Deus, huh?

15:34.140 --> 15:37.830
What a luxury to have you watch over my death.

15:39.010 --> 15:43.270
I'm sure we don't belong in the world to come.

15:44.620 --> 15:48.070
Neither you nor I.

15:50.810 --> 15:55.220
I wonder why I was never able to obtain you.

15:55.780 --> 16:00.010
You should never have created 
a Spirit in the first place.

16:00.690 --> 16:04.490
This power is too much for mankind.

16:06.180 --> 16:09.770
Though, well, yes...

16:09.770 --> 16:13.740
if there were some misfortune 
in addition to that...

16:14.950 --> 16:17.870
then it would be that you weren't my type.

16:24.990 --> 16:26.130
I see.

16:26.130 --> 16:28.150
Nothing I could do about that, huh?

16:34.470 --> 16:35.760
Qemetiel.

16:36.620 --> 16:37.340
Ein.

16:56.260 --> 16:58.220
This was for the best.

16:59.140 --> 17:01.790
I was too late in realizing it,

17:02.460 --> 17:08.090
but at least I managed to protect Shido 
and everyone else in the end.

17:09.290 --> 17:12.620
I'm sorry, everyone.

17:14.330 --> 17:15.120
Mio.

17:19.970 --> 17:21.870
I'm sorry, Mio.

17:21.870 --> 17:24.370
I've kept you waiting for an awfully long time.

17:25.780 --> 17:27.100
Shin!

17:27.480 --> 17:29.360
Shin! Shin!

17:29.360 --> 17:30.570
Mio!

17:30.570 --> 17:33.110
I've missed you for so, so long!

17:33.110 --> 17:36.110
I've missed you for so long, too!

17:36.740 --> 17:39.180
From now on, we'll be together forever!

17:39.180 --> 17:39.930
Yeah!

17:52.250 --> 17:53.330
Ike!

17:55.190 --> 17:57.510
Hey, Ellen.

17:58.410 --> 18:00.940
Ike, look at what's happened to you!

18:00.940 --> 18:03.260
We need to get you into 
a medical realizer quick!

18:03.580 --> 18:04.830
It's no use.

18:05.230 --> 18:10.650
I got caught up in an Angel and a Demon King 
canceling each other out at close range.

18:11.270 --> 18:14.400
It's a miracle I'm even still conscious.

18:15.580 --> 18:16.790
Ike...

18:19.060 --> 18:21.770
Hey, Elliot.

18:22.220 --> 18:23.790
Karen, too.

18:25.460 --> 18:28.250
Please, Elliot! Save Ike!

18:28.250 --> 18:29.790
You can do it, can't you?!

18:30.590 --> 18:31.540
Elliot...

18:32.610 --> 18:34.570
I would if I could.

18:34.570 --> 18:36.750
But he's already...

18:42.700 --> 18:45.570
So what brought you all the way here?

18:45.570 --> 18:48.060
Did you come to laugh at me?

18:48.480 --> 18:53.940
Is it that strange that I would want 
to see my friend when he's dying?

18:54.530 --> 18:58.580
Yeah, that was a mean question.

18:58.580 --> 19:02.020
Even though our paths differed,

19:02.020 --> 19:04.990
you and Karen were still my friends.

19:04.990 --> 19:06.200
Besides,

19:06.910 --> 19:10.330
we're also two men 
rejected by the same woman.

19:12.730 --> 19:13.960
That's certainly true.

19:25.260 --> 19:31.610
What? It was this easy to obtain?

19:45.620 --> 19:47.950
Shido! Shido!

19:51.870 --> 19:53.220
Shido!

19:54.190 --> 19:55.880
You're awake?

19:55.880 --> 19:57.450
We were worried about you.

19:57.450 --> 20:02.690
Relief. Kaguya was so fraught with worry 
she was weeping as she clung to you.

20:02.690 --> 20:04.760
I never went that far!

20:05.040 --> 20:06.890
Tohka, where's Mio?

20:13.430 --> 20:15.350
I see.

20:20.190 --> 20:22.950
Ahh, she rejected me in the end.

20:23.510 --> 20:25.630
Said she preferred Shin over me.

20:26.430 --> 20:27.820
I see.

20:27.820 --> 20:29.540
Nothing we can do about that then.

20:30.050 --> 20:34.620
I suppose this means even you weren't 
a match for that pure-love couple.

20:38.710 --> 20:39.420
Huh?

21:23.230 --> 21:29.300
You finally got to see Shin, huh Mio?

21:46.020 --> 21:46.980
Shido!

21:49.770 --> 21:52.310
Sorry I'm late, Shido.

21:53.320 --> 21:55.620
I only just got here myself.

23:15.670 --> 23:17.630
Now, Shido,

23:18.030 --> 23:19.630
let's enjoy our date!
